    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Languages",
     "texto": [
      "**Limba română** means «the Romanian language»; **limba spaniolă** means «the Spanish language». «Limba» is the definite form of «limbă» (language)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Speaking",
     "texto": [
      "The verb **a vorbi** changes according to the person. In Romanian the pronoun is usually left out when the verb form already shows who is speaking."
